Package: pulsaros-island
Version: 1.1.1
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Jaime <info@inled.es>
Depends: python3, python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, gir1.2-gtk4layershell-1.0, gnome-shell (>= 45)
Description: Clipboard & Drop Island for Pulsar OS.
 A floating macOS-style island (GTK4 layer-shell daemon) that appears when you
 copy text, an image or take a screenshot, holds the content so you can drag it
 into any window, and accepts files dropped onto it from any app.
